## Verification model (READ THIS — full disclosure, no red-as-green)
`Tooltip` is a STAGED P4 shared surface under apps/apple/TeslaSync/shared-surfaces/.
That directory IS referenced by apps/apple/project.yml (both app targets compile the
`*.swift`, both XCTest bundles compile the co-located `*Tests.swift`), so at integration
time the surface and its tests build with the app. HOWEVER, the literal gate command
`xcodebuild -scheme TeslaSync … build test` first runs the scheme PRE-ACTION
"Stage Shared.xcframework" (apps/apple/Scripts/build-shared-xcframework.sh →
`apps/shared/gradlew :core:assembleSharedXCFramework`), i.e. it assembles the KMP
Kotlin/Native `Shared.xcframework` (ADR-004). The script itself documents this as a
CI-only step ("Requires the Kotlin/Native Apple toolchain (full Xcode). On CI this runs
on a macos-latest runner"); Frameworks/Shared.xcframework is NOT staged in the tree
(only a .gitkeep). A bounded probe of the literal command was run and confirms the
gating factor verbatim:

    SchemeAction Stage\ Shared.xcframework /var/folders/.../SchemeScriptAction-*.sh
    (build-shared-xcframework.sh → gradle :core:assembleSharedXCFramework / Kotlin-Native)

The probe entered that pre-action and was stopped before completing the Kotlin/Native
toolchain assembly (a shared, non-CI host). This is the SAME environment constraint the
prior 0231 run and the 0071 precedent documented.

To run a REAL xcodebuild build+test of the ACTUAL committed sources WITHOUT the CI-only
KMP pre-action, a scoped throwaway XcodeGen project (/tmp/tooltipgate, NOT committed) was
generated. It compiles the REAL committed surface files
(Tooltip.Adapter/Model/Views/Tooltip/Previews) + the REAL design tokens
(apps/design/generated/apple/Tokens.swift) + the REAL TSDesign.swift + TSMaterial.swift
into an app module named `TeslaSync`, and runs the REAL committed XCTest files
(Tooltip.Tests.swift + Tooltip.AdapterTests.swift, `@testable import TeslaSync`) verbatim
on the real Xcode 26.5 toolchain under SWIFT_VERSION=6.0 / SWIFT_STRICT_CONCURRENCY=complete,
deploymentTarget iOS 18.0 / macOS 15.0. The gate compiled the EXACT committed bytes —
sha256 of each /tmp copy was verified equal to the committed source:

    OK Tooltip.Adapter.swift  OK Tooltip.Model.swift  OK Tooltip.Views.swift
    OK Tooltip.swift          OK Tooltip.Previews.swift
    OK Tooltip.Tests.swift    OK Tooltip.AdapterTests.swift

This is faithful (real iOS-Simulator + real macOS build+test of the real code/tests) and
matches the accepted 0071 / prior-0231 scoped-project precedent.

